    "profile: T5 flat-sideways (third review): the centred Account sheet's text column (186–760 pt) crosses the inactive division. Unchanged from before the migration: the pattern's sheet rule centres sheets while flat; no pattern page says how a sheet's own content should reflow. Book is fixed (trailing half, verified)",
